      "site": "internal/promql/lower.go:lower#d33d0084",
      "message": "promql: unsupported expression %T",
      "class": "internal",
      "rationale": "Every expression shape reaching lower() through the HTTP handlers is dispatched (top-level matrix selectors included). The remaining inhabitants — NumberLiteral and StringLiteral, answered by the handler's constant fold / string shortcut before the engine runs, and StepInvariantExpr, which only parser.PreprocessExpr mints and cerberus never calls — cannot arrive here from the wire.",
      "evidence": {
        "guard": [
          "default of switch e := expr.(type) over [case *parser.VectorSelector; case *parser.Call; case *parser.AggregateExpr; case *parser.ParenExpr; case *parser.BinaryExpr; case *parser.SubqueryExpr; case *parser.MatrixSelector; case *parser.UnaryExpr; default]"
